# A test project whose name ends in `.UnitTests`: `test:` runs that project, not the whole solution. The
# other levels have entries of their own (`test.integration:`, `e2eTest:`, `architecture:`), and a
# whole-solution `test:` would run their suites a second time at every gate, all projects side by side.
# `covers.test:` is taken back: the project path says what the command runs.
kind: unit
order: 30
detect.exists: **/*.UnitTests.csproj
test: dotnet test {match_dir} --logger trx
covers.test:
